<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>Cautionary Note Regarding Forward-Looking Statements</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">This press release and statements of our management
made in connection therewith contain or may contain &quot;forward-looking statements&quot; (as defined in Section 27A of the Securities
